game_6106554\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows and Linux</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://galaxytrail.itch.io/petal-crash-2/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><a class=\"sale_link\" href=\"https://itch.io/s/202493/petal-crash-2-launch-discount\"><div class=\"sale_label\"><div class=\"main_label\">On Sale!</div><div class=\"sub_label\"><span class=\"sale_rate\">10%</span> Off</div></div></a><span class=\"dollars original_price\">$16.99</span> <span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$15.29 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Simple rules bloom into endless puzzle possibilities in Petal Crash 2!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>It&#x27;s easy to get started: Throw blocks around your board and match them into bursts of color, sending other blocks flying. Line it up right and you can cause a cascading chain reaction of floral fireworks! Petal Crash takes a minute to learn, and years to master - and it&#x27;ll be a blast the whole time!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>In the fantasy land of Florea, seven magic flowers each found their way into the hands of an ordinary person with a dream, and set them on a journey to find their hearts&#x27; true desires. Colorful clashes marked where their paths crossed, and each found a way to fulfill their wishes - though they aren&#x27;t the only ones with dreams, and there&#x27;s more than one way to make a dream come true... ready or not, it&#x27;s time for another Petal Crash!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Petal Crash 2 takes everything good about the first game to the next level. Streamlined mechanics make gameplay smoother than ever, and the action is easy to follow with new arcade style graphics.</p>\r\n<p>There&#x27;s plenty of arcade action to be had in Early Access, with more to come as the game develops - including built-in online play and a brand new adventure! Take your first steps with us on your new puzzle journey!</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_9163523\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"05 October 2026 @ 23:49 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 18 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 20:14 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 1 total ratings\" itemscope tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"5.0\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 100.00000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-h